          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The cross-country train-adventure game is on its way! It's a fresh take on the iconic board game in stunning 3D. Play with friends, family and players of all ages around the world. Drive your enterprise from coast to coast and strategise as lines collide and direct routes grow!",
